{"title":"Selenium 元素定位方法详解与实战","slug":"2024-07-26-selenium_元素定位","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.095Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-selenium_元素定位.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<p>在进行 Web 自动化测试或爬虫开发时，精准定位页面元素是核心第一步。Selenium WebDriver 提供了多种元素定位策略，以适应不同的页面结构需求。</p>\n<p>本文将以百度首页为例，演示如何使用 Python 版 Selenium 进行常见的元素定位操作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"环境准备\"><a href=\"#环境准备\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"环境准备\"></a>环境准备</h3><p>确保已安装 Selenium 库及对应的浏览器驱动。核心导入代码如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> webdriver</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.common.by <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> By</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 常用元素定位方法详解</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">以下代码演示了八种核心定位方式。请注意区分 `find_element`（查找单个元素）与 `find_elements`（查找多个元素，返回列表）的区别。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 1. 初始化浏览器</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">首先，我们需要启动浏览器并打开目标页面。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 初始化 Chrome 浏览器驱动</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver = webdriver.Chrome()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 打开百度首页</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://www.baidu.com&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 2. ID 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ID 是页面上元素的唯一标识，通常定位速度最快且最准确。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通过 ID 属性定位百度搜索框的“百度一下”按钮</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_element(By.ID, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;su&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 3. NAME 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">NAME 属性通常用于表单元素，定位方式与 ID 类似。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通过 NAME 属性定位百度搜索输入框</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_element(By.NAME, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;wd&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 4. XPATH 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">XPath 是一种强大的路径定位语言，几乎可以定位页面上的任何元素。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 XPath 路径定位 ID 为 &#x27;su&#x27; 的 input 元素</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：此处使用 find_elements 会返回一个列表，即使只找到一个元素也是列表形式</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//input[@id=&quot;su&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 5. TAG_NAME 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">通过标签名（如 `<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>`, `div`, `a`）定位。由于页面中同类标签通常很多，一般配合 `find_elements` 使用。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查找页面上所有的 input 标签</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.TAG_NAME, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;input&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 6. CSS_SELECTOR 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">CSS 选择器定位速度快，语法简洁，是常用的定位方式之一。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 CSS 选择器语法定位 ID 为 &#x27;su&#x27; 的元素 (# 代表 ID)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;#su&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 7. LINK_TEXT 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">专门用于定位超链接 `&lt;a&gt;` 标签，通过链接的完整文本内容进行匹配。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通过链接文本“新闻”定位导航栏中的新闻链接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.LINK_TEXT, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;新闻&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 8. 保持会话</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">在脚本执行完毕前，添加输入暂停，防止浏览器立即关闭，便于观察结果。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">input</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;Press Enter to exit...&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 完整代码示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">以下是整合后的完整代码，可直接用于测试：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> webdriver</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.common.by <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> By</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 初始化驱动并访问目标网址</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver = webdriver.Chrome()</span><br><span class=\"line\">driver.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://www.baidu.com&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. ID 定位 (推荐，唯一性强)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_element(By.ID, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;su&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;ID定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. NAME 定位 (常用于表单)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_element(By.NAME, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;wd&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;NAME定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. XPATH 定位 (灵活性高)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：find_elements 返回的是列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//input[@id=&quot;su&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;XPATH定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 5. TAG_NAME 定位 (通常用于定位多个同类元素)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.TAG_NAME, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;input&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;TAG_NAME定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 6. CSS Selector 定位 (效率高，语法优美)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;#su&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;CSS_SELECTOR定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 7. LINK_TEXT 定位 (专用于 &lt;a&gt; 标签)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.LINK_TEXT, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;新闻&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;LINK_TEXT定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 8. 暂停脚本，等待用户按键后结束</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">input</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;Press Enter key to exit...&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<p>在进行 Web 自动化测试或爬虫开发时，精准定位页面元素是核心第一步。Selenium WebDriver 提供了多种元素定位策略，以适应不同的页面结构需求。</p>\n<p>本文将以百度首页为例，演示如何使用 Python 版 Selenium 进行常见的元素定位操作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"环境准备\"><a href=\"#环境准备\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"环境准备\"></a>环境准备</h3><p>确保已安装 Selenium 库及对应的浏览器驱动。核心导入代码如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> webdriver</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.common.by <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> By</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 常用元素定位方法详解</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">以下代码演示了八种核心定位方式。请注意区分 `find_element`（查找单个元素）与 `find_elements`（查找多个元素，返回列表）的区别。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 1. 初始化浏览器</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">首先，我们需要启动浏览器并打开目标页面。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 初始化 Chrome 浏览器驱动</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver = webdriver.Chrome()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 打开百度首页</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://www.baidu.com&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 2. ID 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ID 是页面上元素的唯一标识，通常定位速度最快且最准确。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通过 ID 属性定位百度搜索框的“百度一下”按钮</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_element(By.ID, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;su&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 3. NAME 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">NAME 属性通常用于表单元素，定位方式与 ID 类似。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通过 NAME 属性定位百度搜索输入框</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_element(By.NAME, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;wd&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 4. XPATH 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">XPath 是一种强大的路径定位语言，几乎可以定位页面上的任何元素。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 XPath 路径定位 ID 为 &#x27;su&#x27; 的 input 元素</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：此处使用 find_elements 会返回一个列表，即使只找到一个元素也是列表形式</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//input[@id=&quot;su&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 5. TAG_NAME 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">通过标签名（如 `<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>`, `div`, `a`）定位。由于页面中同类标签通常很多，一般配合 `find_elements` 使用。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查找页面上所有的 input 标签</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.TAG_NAME, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;input&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 6. CSS_SELECTOR 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">CSS 选择器定位速度快，语法简洁，是常用的定位方式之一。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 CSS 选择器语法定位 ID 为 &#x27;su&#x27; 的元素 (# 代表 ID)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;#su&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 7. LINK_TEXT 定位</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">专门用于定位超链接 `&lt;a&gt;` 标签，通过链接的完整文本内容进行匹配。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通过链接文本“新闻”定位导航栏中的新闻链接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.LINK_TEXT, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;新闻&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(button)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 8. 保持会话</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">在脚本执行完毕前，添加输入暂停，防止浏览器立即关闭，便于观察结果。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">input</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;Press Enter to exit...&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 完整代码示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">以下是整合后的完整代码，可直接用于测试：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> webdriver</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> selenium.webdriver.common.by <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> By</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 初始化驱动并访问目标网址</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">driver = webdriver.Chrome()</span><br><span class=\"line\">driver.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://www.baidu.com&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. ID 定位 (推荐，唯一性强)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_element(By.ID, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;su&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;ID定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. NAME 定位 (常用于表单)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_element(By.NAME, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;wd&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;NAME定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. XPATH 定位 (灵活性高)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：find_elements 返回的是列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.XPATH, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;//input[@id=&quot;su&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;XPATH定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 5. TAG_NAME 定位 (通常用于定位多个同类元素)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.TAG_NAME, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;input&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;TAG_NAME定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 6. CSS Selector 定位 (效率高，语法优美)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.CSS_SELECTOR, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;#su&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;CSS_SELECTOR定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 7. LINK_TEXT 定位 (专用于 &lt;a&gt; 标签)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">button = driver.find_elements(By.LINK_TEXT, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;新闻&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;LINK_TEXT定位结果: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;button&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 8. 暂停脚本，等待用户按键后结束</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">input</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;Press Enter key to exit...&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"Web Automation","path":"api/categories/Web Automation.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"Project","path":"api/tags/Project.json"},{"name":"Selenium","path":"api/tags/Selenium.json"}]}